        got [[],["prio27om"]]   want [["“cycle.html” was not imported: the RCN / EEIC list at the saved state.appns.om.rcn holds the key “K1” twice (rcn[0] and rcn[1]); a key names one combination.\n\nAn RCN / EEIC list names each combination once, by a text key of its own. This file says ORBIT v2.00 saved it, from a board that held such a list. A list that is not a locked cycle’s can be put right on a board of this version, in 🗂 RCN / EEIC, where ✕ on a row marked ⚠ repeats removes that row alone, and the file written again. A whole board of your own comes across with its lists as they are by 📁 File → ⬅ Import a full board, which says first what they hold. That replaces this board’s whole BAE list and execution data with the file’s, when it carries them, so it is not the way to take one appropriation. Nothing on this board was changed."],[]]
